{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06441","headline":"题卢五旧居 · 李颀","name":"题卢五旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"物在人亡无见期，闲庭系马不胜悲。\n窓前绿竹生空地，门外青山如旧时。\n怅望秋天鸣坠叶，漓岏枯柳宿寒鸱。\n忆君泪落东流水，岁岁花开知爲谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06441.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06441","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}